STREAMLIT APP — PIPELINE & IMPLEMENTATION DOCUMENT

Date: May 10, 2026
Project: FMD Early Warning — Streamlit App
Author: Team (audit generated)

PURPOSE

This document describes the full prediction pipeline, core logic, pages, functionality, appearance guidelines, data flow, and deployment notes for the Streamlit application that implements the two-stage FMD prediction system. It maps UI components to the originating notebooks and trained models. It is intended as a single reference document for developers, analysts, and stakeholders.

