Predictable Years (what can be predicted and how)
- Historical predictions (direct inference): Years contained in training data: **2017–2024** — predictions for these years use exact historical rows when available.
- Immediate next forecast month after training end: **January 2025** is the first chronological month not present in data and thus the first forward forecast month.
- Climatological extrapolations (allowed in app): **2025 onward** (app supports selecting future years, e.g., 2025–2030) — these are computed using historical monthly averages for the target month (2017–2024) and overriding seasonal features (sin/cos, monsoon). Use these as extrapolations, not model retraining.
- Recommended practice: Use direct historical predictions for 2017–2024; use climatological forecasts for 2025+ and clearly label them as extrapolations in UI.

